sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Reception UI
    participant OPD as opd-management
    participant APT as appointment-service
    participant Q as queue-service
    participant D as Doctor Dashboard
    participant CS as consultation-service
    participant PS as prescription-service
    participant OS as order-service
    participant LAB as Lab order-service
    participant PH as Pharmacy UI
    participant NS as notification-service

    R->>OPD: registerWalkIn(patient, doctor)
    OPD->>APT: createWalkInAppointment
    OPD->>Q: generateToken
    Q-->>NS: token SMS

    D->>Q: callNext
    Q->>CS: startConsultation
    D->>CS: updateConsultation(vitals, notes, diagnosis)
    D->>PS: createPrescription
    PS->>OS: pushToPharmacyQueue
    D->>LAB: createLabOrder
    D->>CS: completeConsultation

    CS->>OS: createConsultationBill
    PH->>OS: dispensePrescription → GST order

    LAB-->>NS: resultReady → notify patient
    LAB-->>D: result alert on dashboard
